  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Soft Touch is a high-performance multifilament built from 1,470 high-modulus PA 66 polyamide fibers that are twisted and bonded with a soft polyurethane resin. The construction is designed to provide exceptional resiliency, maximum power, excellent ball feel and very high arm comfort. It is particularly well suited to players who prioritize playability and power over the firm response of polyester. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes power and feel, the 1.30 mm version provides the best overall balance, and the 1.35 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "MSV Soft Touch 是一款高性能多芯球线，由 1,470 根高模量 PA 66 聚酰胺微纤维扭合后，再使用柔软聚氨酯树脂进行结合。其结构强调高回弹、最大力量输出、优秀触球感以及非常出色的手臂舒适性，非常适合重视可打性、力量和护臂表现，而不喜欢硬质聚酯反馈的球员。1.25 毫米版本更强调力量和手感；1.30 毫米综合表现最均衡；1.35 毫米版本则提供更高耐久性和稳定性。"
  },

